<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">RRK51.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Abafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abafilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAFILIPI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Nyowe Paulo na Timoseo, abahuuku ba Kristo Yesu, twabahandiikira, imwe abarikwera boona omuri Kristo Yesu, abatwire Filipi hamwe n'abareeberezi n'abadiikoni; <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />nitubendeza ahari Ruhanga Tataitwe na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okworeka okukunda kwe aharibo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:4">1 Kor 1:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nsiima Ruhanga wangye ahu mbaijukira hoona, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />kandi omu kushaba kwangye kwona okw'obutoosha mbashabira mwena n'okushemererwa, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ahabw'okuba mukakwatanisa naanye omu kubuzya engiri okwiha ahu mwatandikiire n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:13">Fil 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:6-8">1 Kor 1:6-8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi hoona nimpamiza kimwe ngu: Ogwo owaatandikire omurimo murungi omuriimwe aryaguhikiiriza aha kiro kya Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Kandi kinshemereire kubateekateekaho ntyo mwena, ahakuba muntuura aha mutima, kandi mwena mukwataniise naanye omu mbabazi za Ruhanga, omu kubohwa kandi n'omu kurwanirira engiri kwangye n'okugihamya. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:9">Rom 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga niwe kareebi wangye, naamanya ku mbainiire orushusho mwena omu mbabazi za Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Kandi eki ndikubashabira n'eki, ngu okukunda kwanyu kugume kweyongyere kikanya omu kumanya n'okwetegyereza kwona, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:23">1 Tes 5:23</ref>. </char></note> mubone kusiima ebirikukira oburungi, mushangwe mutaine buryarya nari akamogo aha kiro kya Kristo, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:12">Efe 1:12</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 1:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:8">Yoh 15:8</ref>. </char></note> mwijwire ebyana by'okuhikiirira ebi Yesu Kristo arikwanira omuriimwe, mubone kuhaisa Ruhanga ekitiinisa n'okumuhimbisa.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubohwa kwa Paulo okuhimbisisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Niinyenda kubamanyisa, B'eishe-emwe, ngu ebyambaireho bikaija kwongyera kubuzya engiri, <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:22">Fil 4:22</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba kikamanywa abaserukare boona abarikurinda Kaisari n'abandi boona, ku naabohirwe ahabwa Kristo; <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />kandi ab'eishe-emwe abarikukira obwingi kyabareetera kuhama omuri Mukama ahabw'okubohwa kwangye, baayeyongyera kugira obumanzi bw'okugamba ekigambo kya Ruhanga bataine bwoba. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />N'ekya buzima abamwe nibagamba Kristo ahabw'eihari n'empaka, kwonka abandi nibamugamba n'omutima murungi; <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />abo babuurira Kristo ahabw'okukunda, nibamanya ngu ndi aha ahabw'okurwana aha ngiri: <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />kwonka abandi tibarikumugamba mu mazima, kureka okurwanira orubaju rwabo, nibagira ngu nibaija kuunyongyera obusaasi omu kubohwa kwangye. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Mbwenu ninfa ki? Kizima omu buryo bwona, yaaba mu buryarya, yaaba omu mazima, Kristo naagambwa; ekyo nikyo ndikushemerererwa, kandi ndyakishemerererwa.<verse eid="PHP 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubaho kwaitu ni Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Ahakuba nimmanya ngu, ahabw'okushaba kwanyu n'okuhwerwa Omwoyo wa Yesu Kristo ekyo kiryandugiramu okujunwa, <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:16">1 Pet 4:16</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku ntegyereize kimwe n'amatsiko, ngu tihariho kyona ekirinkwatsa enshoni, kureka nk'oku kyabaire kiri kare, hoona na hati mbwenu Kristo aryaguma ahimbisibwe n'obumanzi bwingi omu mubiri gwangye, yaaba ndiho nari nfiire; <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />ahakuba ahariinye okugumaho ni Kristo, n'okufa n'enshaagi; <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />kwonka ebyangye yaaba kugumaho omu mubiri, nikyo kirikanyisa ebyana omu murimo gwangye. Nyowe tindikumanya ki nshemereire kutooranaho. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:8">2 Kor 5:8</ref>. </char></note> Ndi embaju zombi; nkaayenzire kugyenda kuguma na Kristo, ahabw'okuba ekyo nikyo kirikukirira kimwe oburungi. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Kwonka shi ahabwanyu okugumaho omu mubiri nikyo kirikwetengwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ahabw'okwetegyereza ekyo, nimmanya ngu niinyija kugumaho, ntuure naimwe mwena, mubone kweyongyera omu maisho omu kwikiriza kandi n'okukushemerererwamu, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />okwehimbisa kwanyu kubone kukanya omuri Kristo Yesu ahabwangye, ku ndiba naagarukire owaanyu. <verse eid="PHP 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:12">1 Tes 2:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka emitwarize yaanyu ebe eshemereire engiri ya Kristo; ku ndiba naizire nari ntaizire kubareeba, mpurire ebyanyu ngu muhamire mwine omwoyo gumwe, nimurwana aha kwikiriza kw'engiri n'omutima gumwe, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />kandi mutarikutiinisibwa bazigu omu kigambo kyona; ekyo n'akamanyiso k'okuhwerekyerera aharibo akarikumanywa, kwonka ahariimwe n'ak'okujunwa kwanyu akarikuruga ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Ahakuba timurahairwe kwikiriza Kristo kwonka, kureka n'okubonabonesibwa ahabwe, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Byak 16:22</ref>. </char></note> nimurwana orugamba, nk'oku mwandeebire, kandi oru murikumpuriraho na hati.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo okucureerera okufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Ku haraabe hariho okugumibwa omuri Kristo, nari okuhuumurizana okurikuruga omuri rukundo, nari okukwatanisa omu Mwoyo, nari embabazi n'esaasi, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />muhikiirize okushemererwa kwangye ahabw'okugira omutima gumwe omu kukundana, nimwikirizana n'omutima gumwe. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:10">Rom 12:10</ref>. </char></note> Mutarikora ekintu kyona ahabw'okurwanira orubaju nari okwekuza, kureka omu bucureezi omuntu weena asiime mugyenzi we okukira oku arikwesiima. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:24">1 Kor 10:24</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 10:33">33</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena omuriimwe arekye kweta aha bye wenka, kureka ayete n'aha by'abandi. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Mugire omutima guri ogwabaire guri omuri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yoh 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo, n'obu araabe yaabaire ari omu muringo gwa Ruhanga, tarateekateekire okwingana na Ruhanga ku kiri ekintu eki ashemereire kugumya; <verse eid="PHP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:3">Isa 53:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:14">Heb 2:14</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 2:17">17</ref>. </char></note> kureka akeeyihaho ekitiinisa, yaikiriza kuhinduka nk'omuhuuku, yaazaarwa omu muringo gw'abantu; <verse eid="PHP 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:2">Heb 12:2</ref>. </char></note> ku yaareebirwe ari omu muringo gw'omuntu, yaayecureeza, yaayoroba okuhika aha kufa, kandi okufa okw'aha musharaba. <verse eid="PHP 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:3">Heb 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 1:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Ruhanga yaamukuriize munonga, akamuha eiziina eririkukira amaziina goona, <verse eid="PHP 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:13">Kush 5:13</ref>. </char></note> ngu boona abari omu iguru n'omu nsi n'okuzimu batsimbire amaju eiziina rya Yesu, <verse eid="PHP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />kandi endimi zoona zaature ku Yesu Kristo ari Mukama, Ruhanga Tataitwe ahimbisibwe.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakristaayo okuba nk'etabaaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo, abarikukundwa, nk'oku mwabaire mworoba obutoosha, na mbwenu mube nikwo mwahikiiriza okujunwa kwanyu mwine obwoba n'okutetema, t'obu ndiho bwonka, kureka okukira munonga n'obu ntariho; <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />ahakuba Ruhanga niwe akorera omuriimwe, akabaha okukunda ebi asiima n'okubikora. <verse eid="PHP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Mukore byona mutarikwetomboita, mutaine mpaka, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:16">Mat 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:8">Efe 5:8</ref>. </char></note> mubone kuba abataine ky'okuhanwa nari oburyarya, muri abaana ba Ruhanga abataine kamogo, ahagati y'ab'obusingye obu obukiikami, oburikwehabagiza, abu mwakiramu nk'etabaaza omu nsi, nimworeka ekigambo ky'amagara, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:2">Gal 2:2</ref>. </char></note> naanye ngire eki ndyehimbisizaho aha izooba rya Kristo, ku ntarairukiire busha, nari ku ntarakoreire busha. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:6">2 Tim 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'obu eshagama yangye yaakuba nk'empongano y'eby'okunywa eshukwa aha kitambo ky'okuheereza Ruhanga ky'okwikiriza kwanyu, nkaananuka, nshemererwa hamwe naimwe mwena. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:1">Fil 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:4">4:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naimwe mukaananuka mutyo, mushemererwa hamwe naanye.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okutuma Timoseo na Epafurodiito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Nyine amatsiko omuri Mukama waitu Yesu kubatumaho juba Timoseo, naanye nkaagarukwa omutima omunda, naamanya eby'owaanyu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ahakuba tiinyine ondiijo nkawe, orita omutima munonga aha byanyu. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Tim 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 4:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Abandi boona nibasherura ebyabo bonka, ti bya Yesu Kristo; <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />kwonka omugasho gwa Timoseo nimugumanya; nk'oku omwana akorera ishe, nikwo yaakozire naanye omu kubuzya engiri. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo ogwo niwe nyine amatsiko kwohereza ahonaaho, naaheza kureeba ebyangye oku byaba; <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />kandi niinyesiga Mukama ngu naanye niinyija kwija juba. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:18">Fil 4:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nkateekateeka ku nshemereire kubatumaho Epafurodiito, mwene waitu, ou tukwataniise omurimo n'orugamba, kandi entumwa ei mwanyoherereize kumpwera omu bi ndikwetenga; <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />ahabw'okuba akabagirira orushusho mwena; kandi yaashaasha ahabw'okuba mukahurira ku yaabaire arwaire. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Kandi n'ekya buzima akaba arwaire, ari haihi kufa. Kwonka Ruhanga akamugirira embabazi, kandi tiwe yaazigiriire wenka, naanye akazingirira, ngu obusaasi burekye kuntembekyeranaho. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Nikyo nteereireho omutima kumubooherereza, ngu mushemererwe ahabw'okugaruka kumureeba, kandi naanye obusaasi bwangye butuube. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:17">1 Tim 5:17</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mumwakiire omuri Mukama n'okushemererwa kwingi; kandi abantu nk'abo mubahe ekitiinisa, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />ahakuba akaba ari haihi kufa ahabw'omurimo gwa Kristo, ayogire amagara ge, ngu abone kuhikiiriza eby'okumpwera kwanyu.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Okufeerwa byona ahabwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 4:4">Fil 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eky'aha muheru, B'eishe-emwe, mushemererwe omuri Mukama. Okugaruka kubahandiikira ebyo, ahabwangye tikirikundusya, kandi ahabwanyu nikibareetera obusingye.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 22:15">Kush 22:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwerinde ezo mbwa, mwerinde ezo nkozi z'ebibi, mwerinde abo abafa okushara kwonka. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Rom 2:29</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba abashazirwe omu mazima niitwe, abaramya Ruhanga omu Mwoyo, abeehimbisiza omuri Kristo Yesu, kandi abateesiga mubiri; <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:18">2 Kor 11:18</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 11:22">22</ref>. </char></note> nyowe n'obu ndaabe nyine ekirikuunyesigisa omubiri. Omuntu ondiijo ku yaakuteekateeka kwesiga omubiri, nkaaba nimmukira. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nkasharwa aha kiro kya munaana, ndi ow'omu ihanga rya Israeli, ow'omu ruganda rwa Benyamiini, Omuheburaayo enzaarwa, omu by'Ebiragiro ndi Omufarisaayo; <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />omu by'obweziriki nkahiiga ekanisa; omu kuhikiirira okw'okukwata Ebiragiro nkaba ntaine ki ndikugaywaho. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:44">Mat 13:44</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:46">46</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ebyo ebyabaire biri nk'enshaagi ahariinye, nkabibara nk'ebifiire ahabwa Kristo; <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />kandi buzima byona nimbibara nk'ebifiire, ahabw'okuba okumanya Kristo Yesu Mukama wangye nikubikira munonga. Ahabw'Ogwo nkafeerwa byona, naabibara nk'eshaabo, ngu mbone kutunga Kristo, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:21">Rom 3:21</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 3:22">22</ref>. </char></note> kandi ndeebwe ndi omuriwe, ntaine kuhikiirira okwangye ahabwangye okw'okuhitsya Ebiragiro, kureka okuri omu kwikiriza Kristo, nikwo kuhikiirira okuruga ahari Ruhanga ahabw'okwikiriza; <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:3-5">Rom 6:3-5</ref>. </char></note> ngu mmumanye, kandi mmanye n'amaani ag'okuzooka kwe, nkwatanise nawe omu kubonabonesibwa kwe, nshushane nawe omu kufa kwe, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:5">Kush 20:5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 20:6">6</ref>. </char></note> naanye, ku kiribaasika, mbone kuhika aha kuzooka omu bafu.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Tindikugira ngu mperize kukitunga, nari shi ngu mperize kuhikiirizibwa; kwonka ningumizamu, ngu naanye nkwate ekyo eki Kristo Yesu yankwatiire. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />B'eishe-emwe, tindikweteekateekaho ngu naaherize kukikwata; kureka eki ndikukora ni kimwe; niinyebwa eby'enyima, ninkununkirira eby'omumaisho, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:24">1 Kor 9:24</ref>. </char></note> niinyezirika kuhika aharikuhakanirwa ngu mpeebwe ekihembo eky'okweta kwa Ruhanga omuri Kristo Yesu okw'okuba omu iguru. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />N'ahabw'ekyo itwe abahikiriire twena oku turikwingana, tuteekateekye tutyo; kandi ku muraateekateekye okundi aha kintu kyona, nakyo Ruhanga aryakibashuuruurira. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Kwonka amazima agu tuhikiremu, tube nigo twagyenderamu.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abazigu b'omushara gwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 5:3">1 Pet 5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, mukwatanise mutooreze emitwarize yangye, kandi mwetegyerereze ahari abo abarikugyenda batyo, nk'oku turi eky'okureeberaho ahariimwe. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ahakuba hariho baingi, abu naabagambiireho kaingi, na mbwenu ningaruka kubagambira nindira, nti, batuura bari abazigu b'omusharaba gwa Kristo; <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />emperu yaabo n'okuhwerekyerera, ruhanga waabo n'enda yaabo, nibeehimbisiza omu birikuhemura, emitima yaabo bagitaire aha by'ensi. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:6">Efe 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:1">Kol 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka itwe owaitu n'omu iguru, ei tutegyereza Omujuni kuruga, Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:43">1 Kor 15:43</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:49">49</ref>. </char></note> orihindura emibiri yaitu emyeremwa kuba nk'omubiri gwe ogw'ekitiinisa n'amaani agamubaasisa kwegomoorera byona.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 2:19">1 Tes 2:19</ref>, <ref loc="1TH 2:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, kushemererwa kwangye kandi kirunga kyangye, abu nkunda nkagirira orushusho, mwemerere mutyo muhamire omuri Mukama, abarikukundwa.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ninteisa Eodia, kandi ninteisa na Suntuke, ngu baikirizane omuri Mukama. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:20">Luk 10:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naiwe, mugyenzi wangye ou tukwataniise buzima, ninkweshengyereza kuhwera abakazi abo; ahakuba bakakwatanisa naanye omu murimo gw'engiri, hamwe na Kelementi n'abandi bakozi bagyenzi bangye, abu amaziina gaabo gari omu kitabo ky'amagara.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Mushemererwe obutoosha omuri Mukama; kandi ningaruka kugira nti: Mugume mushemererwe. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:8">Yak 5:8</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 5:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Okworoberana kwanyu kumanywe abantu boona. Mukama waitu ari haihi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:7">1 Pet 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Muteemereza omutima aha kintu kyona, kureka omuri byona mumanyise Ruhanga ebi murikwetenga omu kushaba n'okweshengyereza, kandi musiime. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:15">Kol 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obusingye bwa Ruhanga, oburengire okwetegyereza kw'omuntu weena, buryaguma burinde emitima yaanyu n'obwengye bwanyu omuri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Eky'aha muheru, B'eishe-emwe, byona eby'amazima, byona ebishemereire kuheebwa ekitiinisa, byona eby'oburyo, byona ebishemeire, byona ebirikushemeza, byona ebirikusiimwa, ku haraabe hariho oburungi, ku haraabe hariho ebishemereire kuhimbisibwa, mube nibyo mwateekateekaho. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:20">Rom 16:20</ref>. </char></note> Ebi muunyegyeireho, ebi mwahairwe, ebi mwampuriireho, n'ebi mwandeebireho, mube nibyo mwakora; obwo nibwo Ruhanga mukama w'obusingye ariguma naimwe.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Ninshemererwa munonga omuri Mukama, ahakuba mbwenu aha muheru gwa byona mugarukire kuunyijuka; kandi n'ekya buzima mukaba nimuunyijuka, kwonka mukabura omwanya. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:6">1 Tim 6:6</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo tindikukigambisibwa kwetenga; ahakuba nkeega kumarwa omu muringo gwona ogu mba ndimu. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:10">2 Kor 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Nimmanya okugarurwa ahansi, nimmanya n'okugira ebishaagire; omu kintu kyona n'omu miringo yoona nkeega oburyo bw'okumarwa, omu kwiguta n'omu njara, omu kugira ebishaagire kandi n'omu bworo. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:10">2 Kor 12:10</ref>. </char></note> Nimbaasa kukora byona omuri Kristo ompa amaani.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okusiima ebiconco by'Abafilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Kwonka mukakora gye kukwatanisa naanye omu busaasi bwangye. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2 Kor 11:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi, imwe Abafilipi, nimumanya omu kutandika kw'engiri, obu naaruga Makedonia, tihariho kanisa eyaakwataniise naanye omu kigambo ky'okuha n'okuheebwa, kureka imwe mwenka. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Ahakuba n'omuri Tesalonika mukantwekyera eby'okumpwera, kandi ti rimwe, ni kabiri. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ti kugira ngu ninkunda ebiconco, kureka niinyenda ngu ebyana byanyu byeyongyere, kandi bibabariwe. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:25">Fil 2:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahabwangye nyine ebi ndikwetenga byona, nangwa n'okushaaga nibishaaga; mpaagire, ahabw'okuheebwa ebiconco ebi mwatwekire Epafurodito, ebyambeereire nk'omugaju, ekitambo ekiikirizibwa kandi ekirikusiimwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Kandi Ruhanga wangye aryamara obukyene bwanyu bwona, nk'obutungi bw'ekitiinisa kye omuri Kristo Yesu oku buri. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Ruhanga waitu Tataitwe aheebwe ekitiinisa ebiro n'ebiro. Amiina.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Muramutsye orikwera weena omuri Kristo Yesu. Ab'eishe-emwe abari kunu baabaramutsya. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Abarikwera boona, okukira munonga ab'omu kikaari kya Kaisaari, baabaramutsya. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo zigume n'emyoyo yaanyu.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>